---
---

<section class="section black-800">
        <div class="section-gap contact-faq">
          <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container">
            <div class="section-header left">
              <div class="section-badge">
                <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                <div class="badge-text">COMMON QUESTIONS</div>
              </div>
              <div class="max-width-42 faq-v3">
                <h2 class="section-heading small">A few answers to help you understand how we work, where we can help, and what to expect from an AXIOMET engagement.</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-wrapper">
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">01.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">What does AXIOMET actually do?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">AXIOMET helps technology-driven companies solve complex challenges across strategy, engineering, AI, and intelligent systems—from defining the right direction to building scalable solutions.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">02.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">What types of companies do you work with?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Most of our clients are product teams in robotics, medical technology, energy, and industrial automation, along with software companies whose platforms depend on connected devices and data.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">03.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">Can AXIOMET help us if we only have an idea?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Yes. A rough idea is a fine starting point—we run a short discovery to test demand and feasibility, sketch the first architecture, and estimate what a credible proof of concept would cost.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">04.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">Do you provide strategy or actual engineering support?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Both, depending on where you are. Some clients need a clear technical direction first; others need experienced engineers to design, code, and validate systems that already have a defined scope.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">05.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">How do you approach a complex technical problem?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">We clarify the goal, gather evidence on how the current system behaves, model the options, and prototype the weakest link first, so every decision rests on measured results rather than opinion.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div to-top-0="" class="faq-card v3">
                <div class="faq-left-main v2">
                  <div class="faq-left">
                    <div class="impact-number-wrap">
                      <div class="pill-dot"></div>
                      <div class="font-extra-small">06.</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-right v3 last">
                  <div class="faq-card-top v2">
                    <div class="font-normal">What makes AXIOMET different from a traditional consultancy?</div>
                    <div class="faq-icon-wrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="faq-icon">
                        <path d="M11.9922 4V20M19.9922 12H3.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="faq-summary-wrap">
                    <p class="faq-summary">Instead of rotating junior staff and long reports, you get a small senior team that designs, builds, and measures the solution with you—and stays responsible until it performs in the real world.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
